  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Vicalvi</p>\r\n<div>\u00a0</div>\r\n<div>The city shows evidence of\u00a0<em>opus quadratum </em>fortification walls as well as terracing walls in polygonal masonry. Bloch 1986 suggests the ancient name of the site was\u00a0<em>Vicus albus</em>.</div>",
